    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32983" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκτέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be held,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				259
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑκτέον</span></b> , <i>one must have,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάριν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.11.2
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόνοιαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					<u>Praef.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλέον ἑ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεονεκτητέον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				490c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must behave, comport oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τοὺς κινδύνους εὐρώστως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>VP</u>
					30.173
				</span></i>
			.</div>
